      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Powersmart Solar's professionalism was of the highest callibre - they were honest, upfront and answered every question accurately.  I know I had very high expectations of work quality, and Shane and Marc exceeded these.  Their consideration and attention to detail has given us a solar installation 2nd to none.  Even their electrical contractors installed the wiring out of view as I requested in our flat roofed home with challenging and limited access points.  Being a large domestic installation, I was impressed by their many projects on many of the schools and colleges locally.The alternate quote was friendly enough, but failed due to poor planning (suggesting 700m trenches would be required adding considerable cost!!), poor customer details management, and not wishing to answer questions in writing as requested.Thank you Finn - it can be confusing when you start to research a solar installation, but I was able to navigate my way to final installation intially with your help followed with the team at Powersmart Solar.",
